{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"PeopleSearch.im API","version":"1.0.0","description":"The same people-search backend as PeopleSearch.im, over HTTP. Search a global professional database in plain English, reveal full profiles, and fetch verified professional emails. Pay-as-you-go: 1 credit per profile, credits refunded when a lookup finds nothing. The same tools are also available to AI agents as a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server at https://peoplesearch.im/api/mcp.","termsOfService":"https://peoplesearch.im/legal/terms"},"servers":[{"url":"https://peoplesearch.im"}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]},{"apiKeyHeader":[]}],"x-mcp":{"endpoint":"https://peoplesearch.im/api/mcp","transport":"streamable-http","description":"Remote MCP server exposing the same operations as agent tools. Authenticate with OAuth 2.1 (the MCP authorization spec; the server's 401 points at its protected resource metadata) or with the same API key as this REST API (Bearer token or X-API-Key header).","authorization":{"protectedResourceMetadata":"https://peoplesearch.im/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource/api/mcp","authorizationServerMetadata":"https://peoplesearch.im/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server"},"tools":[{"name":"people_search","title":"Search people","credits":0},{"name":"reveal_profile","title":"Reveal a person","credits":1},{"name":"find_people","title":"Find & unlock a batch of people","credits":1},{"name":"fetch_email","title":"Fetch a verified work email","credits":1},{"name":"find_work_email","title":"Find a person's work email","credits":2},{"name":"verify_email","title":"Verify an email address","credits":1},{"name":"find_company_emails","title":"Find a company's emails","credits":2},{"name":"reverse_email_lookup","title":"Reverse email lookup","credits":13},{"name":"find_linkedin_profile","title":"Find a LinkedIn profile","credits":2},{"name":"lookup_linkedin_profile","title":"Look up a LinkedIn profile","credits":2},{"name":"lookup_company","title":"Look up a company","credits":1},{"name":"company_search","title":"Search companies","credits":0},{"name":"check_credits","title":"Check credit balance","credits":0}]},"paths":{"/api/v1/search":{"post":{"operationId":"searchPeople","summary":"Search people (free)","description":"Find people by exact `filters` (job titles, companies, locations, industries, schools, skills and more) or by a plain-English `query`, and get masked previews plus the true total. One of the two is required; with `filters` the query is only a label. Free; spends no credits.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string","example":"Heads of Marketing at Series B SaaS in New York"},"filters":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PeopleFilters"},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":25,"default":10},"page":{"type":"string","description":"Next-page token from a prior response."},"drop":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Interpreted filter fields to remove and broaden the search."}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Masked previews and the true total.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"total":{"type":"integer"},"results":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"key":{"type":"string","description":"Opaque id for this person, stable across searches. Not their LinkedIn URL or name."},"token":{"type":"string","description":"Pass to /api/v1/reveal to unlock this person."},"maskedName":{"type":"string"},"title":{"type":"string"},"industry":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"companySize":{"type":"integer","nullable":true},"location":{"type":"string","nullable":true}}}},"token":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"description":"Next-page token."},"balance":{"type":"integer","nullable":true},"relaxed":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Filter fields dropped automatically because the query had no exact matches, least essential first. Empty when the query matched as written."},"broadened":{"type":"object","nullable":true,"description":"Present when nobody held the job title as asked and a broader reading of it found people: `from` is the title as asked, `to` as searched (for example Consumer Investigative Reporter -> Investigative Reporter). Tried before any filter is dropped.","properties":{"from":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"to":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}}},"suggestEntity":{"type":"string","enum":["company"],"description":"Present when the words asked for companies rather than people (\"software companies in Berlin\"): the results are people at such companies; search companies for the companies themselves."},"ignored":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Parts of `filters` that could not be applied (an unknown industry name, an unknown field), in plain words. Absent when everything applied."}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key."}}}},"/api/v1/deliver":{"post":{"operationId":"deliverProfiles","summary":"Deliver full profiles (1 credit each)","description":"Re-run a search and unlock up to `count` full profiles in one atomic charge. 1 credit per newly unlocked profile; already-owned profiles are free. Send the same `filters` or `query` you searched with: the search runs exactly as /api/v1/search does, including the automatic broadening when there are no exact matches; any dropped filter fields are listed in `relaxed`.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"},"filters":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PeopleFilters"},"count":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":100},"drop":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The unlocked profiles, each with an id for the email step."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key."},"402":{"description":"Out of credits."}}}},"/api/v1/reveal":{"post":{"operationId":"revealProfile","summary":"Reveal one profile (1 credit)","description":"Unlock a single profile from a search token. Set withEmail to also fetch the verified email (a second credit, refunded if none is found). Idempotent per person.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["token"],"properties":{"token":{"type":"string","description":"A search result's token."},"withEmail":{"type":"boolean","default":false}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The full profile."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key."},"402":{"description":"Out of credits."}}}},"/api/v1/email":{"post":{"operationId":"fetchEmail","summary":"Fetch a verified work email (1 credit)","description":"Look up the professional email for a profile id returned by deliver/reveal. Refunded if no email is found.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["id"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The email and its status."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key."},"402":{"description":"Out of credits."}}}},"/api/v1/tools":{"post":{"operationId":"runTool","summary":"Run a single lookup tool","description":"Dispatch any lookup tool by its id, passing that tool's fields in `input`: work-email-finder (Email Finder by Name: firstname, lastname, domainOrCompany; 2 credits); email-verifier (Email Verifier: email; 1 credit); reverse-email-lookup (Reverse Email Lookup: email; 13 credits); email-finder (Company Email Finder: domainOrCompany; 2 credits); linkedin-profile-finder (LinkedIn Profile Finder: firstname, lastname, companyOrDomain; 2 credits); linkedin-profile-lookup (LinkedIn Profile Lookup: url; 2 credits); company-lookup (Company Lookup: url; 1 credit); company-search (Company Search: query; free). Credits are refunded when a tool finds nothing.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["tool","input"],"properties":{"tool":{"type":"string","enum":["work-email-finder","email-verifier","reverse-email-lookup","email-finder","linkedin-profile-finder","linkedin-profile-lookup","company-lookup","company-search"]},"input":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The tool result."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key."},"402":{"description":"Out of credits."}}}},"/api/v1/credits":{"get":{"operationId":"getCredits","summary":"Get credit balance","description":"Return the current credit balance for the API key.","responses":{"200":{"description":"The balance."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key."}}}}},"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"sk_sift_…","description":"A PeopleSearch.im API key, created at /developers."},"apiKeyHeader":{"type":"apiKey","in":"header","name":"X-API-Key","description":"The same PeopleSearch.im API key (sk_sift_…), sent as a header."}},"schemas":{"PeopleFilters":{"type":"object","description":"Exact filters, recommended for AI agents and programs: state each part of the request instead of a sentence. Values inside one list are alternatives (OR); different fields must all match (AND). Give a few variants where people word things differently (titles: [\"M&A Associate\", \"Investment Banking Associate\"]). When filters are given, `query` is only a label and is not parsed.","properties":{"first_name":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"To find one named person: their first name, with the variants they may use, e.g. [\"Timothy\", \"Tim\"]. Use with last_name, and add companies or company_domains when known (\"Anqi Dai at Memorial Sloan Kettering\" finds the one person)."},"last_name":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"To find one named person: their last name, e.g. [\"Dai\"]. If the name with the employer finds nobody, the search tries the last name at the employer, then the full name anywhere."},"job_titles":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Current job titles, matched as case-insensitive substrings (\"Account Executive\" also finds \"Senior Account Executive\"). Include the variants people use: [\"VP Sales\", \"Vice President of Sales\", \"Head of Sales\"]."},"exclude_job_titles":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Titles to leave out, e.g. [\"Intern\", \"Recruiter\"]."},"past_job_titles":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Titles the person held before their current job."},"companies":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Current employers by name, e.g. [\"Stripe\"]."},"company_domains":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Current employers by website domain, the most exact way to name a company, e.g. [\"stripe.com\"]."},"past_companies":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Former employers by name, e.g. [\"McKinsey\"] for ex-McKinsey people."},"locations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Where the person lives or works: cities, states, countries or regions, e.g. [\"Frankfurt\", \"Munich\"], [\"Germany\"], [\"DACH\"], [\"Texas\"]. Use \"City, Country\" to tell same-named places apart (\"Paris, France\"). Country names are safest; ISO codes are converted."},"industries":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Industry of the current employer, as LinkedIn names it, e.g. [\"Investment Banking\"], [\"Software Development\"], [\"Hospitals and Health Care\"], [\"Venture Capital and Private Equity Principals\"], [\"Staffing and Recruiting\"]. Common older names are mapped; a name that is not an industry is reported in `ignored` and not applied."},"schools":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Schools the person attended, matched as substrings; add the local-language name too, e.g. [\"University of Mannheim\", \"Universität Mannheim\"]."},"skills":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Skills listed on the profile, e.g. [\"Python\", \"Kubernetes\"]."},"languages":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Languages the person speaks, e.g. [\"German\"] or [\"DE\"]."},"keywords":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Words to find anywhere on the profile (headline, descriptions, past roles), for what no other field covers."},"company_keywords":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Words the current employer's own description should contain, for a KIND of employer no industry names exactly, e.g. [\"hostel\"], [\"coffee\"] (founders of coffee roasteries), [\"SEO\"] (with industries [\"Marketing Services\"] for SEO agencies), [\"community college\"]."},"company_size_min":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Minimum employees at the current employer."},"company_size_max":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Maximum employees at the current employer."},"years_experience_min":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Minimum total years of professional experience."},"years_experience_max":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Maximum total years of professional experience."}},"additionalProperties":false}}}}